  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Resilient Community Media Rebuilding Citizen Trust - Cultivating knowledge, skills and environment for more secure community Mobile and Social Media Journalism</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">&lt;p&gt;Impact of the Action will be empowered and protected community media in Serbia contributing to peoples&#xBF; empowerment to improve their social and economic conditions, fight against discrimination, and become more effectively involved in the democratic development of their community and country. Outcomes that will lead to the planned impact are: Oc1. Journalist and media workers from community media in multiethnic communities in Serbia embraced mobile and social media journalism as a tool for bringing politically, economically and socially divided communities together; and Oc2. Safety of journalists and media workers from community media in multiethnic communities in Serbia is humanized as a matter of right as well as an ethical issue, through joint workshops of prosecutors, judiciary and the police officers and Community Media.&lt;/p&gt;</narrative>
  </description>
